  {
    "file": "quiz_d2l_59227.xml",
    "title": "Biology 30 Unit B - Chapter 15 Quiz",
    "id": "OBJ_2131134",
    "stem": "The placenta performs a number of functions throughout pregnancy. Which of the following is NOT a function of the placenta?",
    "stemHtml": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 18pt; font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">The placenta performs a number of functions throughout pregnancy. Which of the following is <strong>NOT</strong> a function of the placenta?</span></p>",
    "images": [],
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "QUES_53340_84826_A282928",
        "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">transports nutrients from the mother&rsquo;s blood to the fetus&rsquo;s blood</span></p>",
        "text": "transports nutrients from the mother\u2019s blood to the fetus\u2019s blood"
      },
      {
        "id": "QUES_53340_84826_A282929",
        "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">forms the foundation for the umbilical cord and becomes part of the urinary bladder</span></p>",
        "text": "forms the foundation for the umbilical cord and becomes part of the urinary bladder"
      },
      {
        "id": "QUES_53340_84826_A282930",
        "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">transports waste from the fetal blood to the mother&rsquo;s blood</span></p>",
        "text": "transports waste from the fetal blood to the mother\u2019s blood"
      },
      {
        "id": "QUES_53340_84826_A282931",
        "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">secretes hormones, such as estrogen, progesterone, and hCG</span></p>",
        "text": "secretes hormones, such as estrogen, progesterone, and hCG"
      }
    ],
    "correctOptionIds": [
      "QUES_53340_84826_A282929"
    ],
    "assets": []
  },
  {
    "file": "quiz_d2l_59227.xml",
    "title": "Biology 30 Unit B - Chapter 15 Quiz",
    "id": "OBJ_2131135",
    "stem": "Which of the following events is most likely to occur in the fetus during the third trimester of pregnancy?",
    "stemHtml": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 18pt; font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Which of the following events is most likely to occur in the fetus during the third trimester of pregnancy?</span></p>",
    "images": [],
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "QUES_53341_84827_A282932",
        "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Growth in length of the body accelerates, but growth of the head slows.</span></p>",
        "text": "Growth in length of the body accelerates, but growth of the head slows."
      },
      {
        "id": "QUES_53341_84827_A282933",
        "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">The bones of the skeleton begin to form, and fetal legs grow and develop.</span></p>",
        "text": "The bones of the skeleton begin to form, and fetal legs grow and develop."
      },
      {
        "id": "QUES_53341_84827_A282934",
        "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Fetal brain cells form rapidly, connecting to form more intricate networks.</span></p>",
        "text": "Fetal brain cells form rapidly, connecting to form more intricate networks."
      },
      {
        "id": "QUES_53341_84827_A282935",
        "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">The cartilage-based skeleton begins to harden.</span></p>",
        "text": "The cartilage-based skeleton begins to harden."
      }
    ],
    "correctOptionIds": [
      "QUES_53341_84827_A282934"
    ],
    "assets": []
  },
  {
    "file": "quiz_d2l_59227.xml",
