    "id": "OBJ_2131136",
    "stem": "In this context, alcohol consumed by the pregnant woman is acting as",
    "stemHtml": "<p><img style=\"max-width: 100%;\" src=\"PastedImage_7wg8rdnaxeddb863gx8hr8ek3yuw2zo2002.png\" /></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">In this context, alcohol consumed by the pregnant woman is acting as</span></p>",
    "images": [
      "PastedImage_7wg8rdnaxeddb863gx8hr8ek3yuw2zo2002.png"
    ],
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "QUES_53342_84828_A282936",
        "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">a carcinogen.</span></p>",
        "text": "a carcinogen."
      },
      {
        "id": "QUES_53342_84828_A282937",
        "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">a teratogen.</span></p>",
        "text": "a teratogen."
      },
      {
        "id": "QUES_53342_84828_A282938",
        "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">an endocrine disruptor.</span></p>",
        "text": "an endocrine disruptor."
      },
      {
        "id": "QUES_53342_84828_A282939",
        "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">a neural tube defect.</span></p>",
        "text": "a neural tube defect."
      }
    ],
